        "desc": "<p><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255)\">Una divisa utilizada únicamente en el Fuerte Merópide.</span><br></p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2025/03/08/73555894/4026d4731993878027111ff57ff40061_3669928454696481992.png",
        "amount": 90,
